	(text "Passive SWD adapter: Raspberry Pi Debug Probe 'D' port (JST-SH 3-pin)\nto ARM Cortex Debug 2x5 1.27mm header.\nVTref (J2-1), SWO (J2-6), KEY (J2-7), NC (J2-8), GNDDetect (J2-9), nRESET (J2-10): no connect.\nDebug Probe is fixed 3.3V logic - no VTref sensing."
		(at 48.26 82.55 0)
		(effects
